UPDATE issues SET Rationale = '<a class=\"ballot\">Status: On Ballot</a>  \nThe protection cost of a position will be based on a free market system. If the number of players protected at a position in the previous 4 years is too high, then the cost of that position increases, and vice versa. A position is considered to be too high or too low if the number protected is outside the range of +/- 5 from the target. The four year range is reset when the cost changes. The targets will be 1 player per team per position per year, except for RB which will be 1.5, WR which will be 1.25 and LB which will be 1.25.' WHERE IssueNum = '2009.3' AND Season = 2009 AND (Rationale IS NULL OR Rationale = '');

UPDATE issues SET RuleChangeText = 'Add rule X.F reading:\n\n> The target number of protections for each position each year shall be equal to their target number times the number of teams in the league.  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;1. Target numbers  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;a. RB  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i. 1.5  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;b. WR and LB  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i. 1.25  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;c. All other positions  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i. 1  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;2. The number of protections at each position in the shorter of the previous 4 years or years since the last position cost change for the position shall be compared to the target number of protections over that same time frame.  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;a. If the number of actual protections exceeds the targeted protections by more than 5, then the appropriate position in rule X.E.1 shall have their point value increased by 1.  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;b. If the targeted number of protections exceeds the actual number of protections by more than 5, then the appropriate position in rule X.E.1 shall have their point value decreased by 1.  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;i. However no position shall have it\'s value decreased below 1.  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;3. The calculation for a given season shall be determined after protections are due and announced at the draft.  \n>  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;a. The changes will take effect the following season.' WHERE IssueNum = '2009.3' AND Season = 2009 AND (RuleChangeText IS NULL OR RuleChangeText = '');

