UPDATE issues SET Rationale = '<a class=\"ballot\">Status: Rejected, 3-8, 1 no vote </a>  \nReturn to two divisions by abolishing one division and putting the teams evenly into the other two divisions in a way that balances the three year record between the two divisions. Doing this the schedule will be the first 11 weeks of the season every team will play every other team once. Then the bottom two teams from each division will be eliminated and play a round-robin over the last three games, the Toilet Bowl would be eliminated. The remaining four teams in each division would play each other over the last three weeks, with the best record in those games winning the division (tiebreak would be overall record). Two wild card teams would also make the playoffs based on overall record. All four playoff teams would be seeded 1-4 based on overall record, without regard to division titles.' WHERE IssueNum = '2013.1c' AND Season = 2013 AND (Rationale IS NULL OR Rationale = '');

