UPDATE issues SET Rationale = '<a class=\"ballot\">Status: Passed, 8-0, 1 abstain, 3 no votes</a>  \nExtend the draft from 12 rounds to 16 rounds. At the same time revamp the timing, so that instead of 2 minutes per pick, each team gets 2 minutes for the whole draft, then 30 seconds added on when their pick comes around. Left over time would remain until the next pick. (eg, if a team had 1:45 left on their clock, when their next pick came around it would increase by 30 seconds to 2:15. If they then took 20 seconds they would have 1:55 left. So the overall clock could grow.) Clock growth would be capped at 5 minutes.' WHERE IssueNum = '2013.4' AND Season = 2013 AND (Rationale IS NULL OR Rationale = '');

